# Caelestia Hyprland on Arch Linux

Caelestia is a highly customized Hyprland configuration focused
on visual design and desktop aesthetics.

It demonstrates how flexible Hyprland can be when combined with
carefully crafted themes, layouts, and UI components. The setup
creates a distinctive desktop environment that feels modern,
polished, and visually unique.

Instead of a minimal tiling workflow, Caelestia emphasizes
personalization and visual identity while still maintaining
the performance benefits of Hyprland on Arch Linux.

---

# Why Use Caelestia

Caelestia is useful for users who want:

- A visually distinctive Hyprland desktop
- Custom themes and UI styling
- A heavily personalized Wayland environment
- An example of advanced Hyprland customization

